1
00:00:00,722 --> 00:00:03,352
(Penny:)-I'm so glad you like it.
-I do.

2
00:00:03,517 --> 00:00:05,187
(Sheldon:)Leonard never cooks for me.

3
00:00:05,352 --> 00:00:07,602
Well, maybe that's because
Leonard can't cook.

4
00:00:07,771 --> 00:00:09,901
(Sheldon:)You can't cook and you made me this.

5
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,860
Whatever. Oh, let me get the cheesecake
out of the fridge.

6
00:00:16,196 --> 00:00:19,196
(Sheldon:)Oh, Lord, I'm in Jewish hell.

7
00:00:24,246 --> 00:00:25,996
[WOMAN MOANS ON COMPUTER]

8
00:00:26,164 --> 00:00:30,544
(Raj:)Look at this. Do you think she's
really doing that or is it Photoshop?

9
00:00:33,964 --> 00:00:36,174
I'm sure
Martha Stewart never got naked...

10
00:00:36,341 --> 00:00:39,341
(Leonard:)...with a room full
of big fat Japanese guys.

11
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:42,140
(Raj:)You don't know that.

12
00:00:42,347 --> 00:00:44,517
(Raj:)Prison changes people.

13
00:00:47,269 --> 00:00:48,849
(Leonard:)Hey, where you been?

14
00:00:50,021 --> 00:00:51,981
(Sheldon:)I told you. Walking.

15
00:00:52,149 --> 00:00:53,979
(Leonard:)For an hour and a half?

16
00:00:54,151 --> 00:00:56,361
(Sheldon:)I got lost.

17
00:00:56,862 --> 00:00:59,072
(Leonard:)How could you get lost?
Your phone has GPS.

